{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:9444f216899dc20b","name":"Dodge","source":{"id":"source:reference-9444f216899dc20b","title":"Dodge","revision":18108,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T19:36:06Z","sha256":"cc88d1c86707b45a32e2f5dbe17be460ff885cdcec7e752e5c1a766372cb3ba6","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18108","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Dodge&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-9444f216899dc20b","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Books: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are adept at dodging blows.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," 13\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Effect:"]}," During your turn, you designate an opponent and receive a +1 dodge bonus to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," against attacks from that opponent. You can select a new opponent on any action. A situation that makes you lose your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," (if any) also makes you lose dodge bonuses. Also, dodge bonuses stack with each other, unlike most other types of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bonuses"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bonuses"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"}," of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," may use Dodge to grant the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," a +1 dodge bonus against a single opponent (whether a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," or a single character).\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Combined Feat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Combined_Feat"},":"]}," If you have the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charging Fire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charging_Fire","referenceId":"reference:b910d2f344c968fd"}," feat, you reduce your penalty to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," against all opponents to -1 when making a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," at the end of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charge","referenceId":"reference:ff9f88ce353a2228"},". Additionally, you can add your dodge bonus to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," against anyone who makes an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attack of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attack_of_Opportunity"}," against you while using the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Running Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Running_Attack","referenceId":"reference:c4bf1e2e022526ec"}," feat.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
